{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49531","headline":"玉楼春 二 · 魏承班","name":"玉楼春 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻歛翠蛾呈皓齿，莺转一枝花影里。\n声声清迥遏行云，寂寂画梁尘暗起。\n玉斝满斟情未已，促坐王孙公子醉。\n春风筵上贯珠匀，艳色韶颜娇旖旎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏承班","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}